@@ -285,7 +285,7 @@ Note 2: Master–vassal(s) changes are intended to strengthen overall AI play by
 
 ### UI (Common)
 
-- (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5513+) **Optionally** support **upscaling font size (i.e. font size)** regardless of game resolution. This affects **main interface** (city screen, map view, `city_billboard`/`CITYBILLBOARD`), **advisors**, **sevopedia**, most of **diplomacy screen** (when it was possible) in [CvDiplomacy.py](/Assets/Python/CvDiplomacy.py) and `CvPlayer::getItemTradeString` (for trading table), **Event Log** window (as of now only **Event Log** and **Combat Log** tabs are supported) and **event message popup** (top-center) in [CvUtil.py](/Assets/Python/CvUtil.py) and [CvEventManager.py](/Assets/Python/CvEventManager.py) and `CvDLLInterfaceIFaceBase::addMessage` (note: Event related message upscaling **only applies to new messages written after upscaling is enabled**, not to previously written event messages before upscaling was applied), and other places where font size could be changed. Made some **UI adjustments when needed to accomodate the larger text**. Upscaling text can be **useful for high resolution displays** (where text appears very small), but may **also improve readability at smaller resolutions** (like 1920*1080 or lower). See [GlobalDefines_advciv_sas.xml](/Assets/XML/GlobalDefines_advciv_sas.xml) and related places for the change.
+- (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5513+) **Optionally** support **upscaling font size (i.e. font size)** regardless of game resolution. This affects **main interface** (city screen, map view, `city_billboard`/`CITYBILLBOARD`), **advisors**, **sevopedia**, most of **diplomacy screen** (when it was possible) in [CvDiplomacy.py](/Assets/Python/CvDiplomacy.py) and `CvPlayer::getItemTradeString` (for trading table), **Event Log** window (as of now only **Event Log** and **Combat Log** tabs are supported) and **event message popup** (top-center) in [CvUtil.py](/Assets/Python/CvUtil.py) and [CvEventManager.py](/Assets/Python/CvEventManager.py) and `CvDLLInterfaceIFaceBase::addMessage` (note: Event related message upscaling **only applies to new messages written after upscaling is enabled**, not to previously written event messages before upscaling was applied), miscallenous screens such as the [CvEraMovieScreen.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvEraMovieScreen.py) (i.e. the e.g., "You have entered the Renaissance era!" screen), and other places where font size could be changed. Made some **UI adjustments when needed to accomodate the larger text**. Upscaling text can be **useful for high resolution displays** (where text appears very small), but may **also improve readability at smaller resolutions** (like 1920*1080 or lower). See [GlobalDefines_advciv_sas.xml](/Assets/XML/GlobalDefines_advciv_sas.xml) and related places for the change.
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5530+) **Upscaling adjustments** include notably: smaller sevopedia leaders item row (else AI Personality Panel's upscaled text overfills), **smaller Sevopedia speeds first column** (only at **lower resolutions** since these don't have enough horizontal room per column to show them without clipping),  **overwrite city `billboard` xml** in [CIV4DetailManager.xml](/Assets/XML/Misc/CIV4DetailManager.xml) **at runtime** via [SASBillboardScale.py](/Assets/Python/SASBillboardScale.py) (**tunable per font size**), increase **GP bar size** and reduce **tech bar size** in **main interface (common)**, **do not upscale icons** in the Foreign Diplomacy Advisor's **Glance Tab** when text is upscaled and there are **>= 2 icons** (e.g., worst enemy + at war icons) (See [KI#116](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues_In_Base_AdvCiv_Civ4.md#116---worked-around-foreign-diplomacy-advisor-glance-tab-clips-trailing-status-icons-at-upscaled-label-fonts)), added **attitude icon chars** in [GameFont.tga](/Assets/res/Fonts/GameFont.tga) (21x20 icon size): previously they existed only in [GameFont_75.tga](/Assets/res/Fonts/GameFont_75.tga) (16x16 icon size), causing attitude icon chars to **disappear** (e.g., in Score Tab) **when font was upscaled (attitude font size >= 3)** (see [KI#117](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues_In_Base_AdvCiv_Civ4.md#117---fixed-score-tab-attitude-icon-chars-disappearing-at-upscaled-label-fonts-sas_ui_font_label-34)).
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5527+) **Increase hover text** base **font size** from **2 to 3** and most UI elements (e.g., scoreboard, advisors, main interface, sevopedia) **from body (i.e. 2) to label (i.e. 3)**, and **increased font2 billboard from 100 to 120 percent** so it is **more readable**.
 - Added **Emojis** without having to tediously implement them as characters. See [Emojis](/README.md#emojis) and [CIV4ArtDefines_Interface.xml](/Assets/XML/Art/CIV4ArtDefines_Interface.xml).
@@ -346,7 +346,7 @@ Note: New panels added or modified mostly not mentioned here for concision. See
 - Added in the **Info Screen** a new **Score Tab** showing a **sortable (default ordered by highest score) table** with all relevant scoreboard fields, plus **new fields** like Player color, Player ID (to distinguish identical Name/Civ/Leader/Player Color), (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5532+) Traits (T1 and T2) as **icon chars**, total Power (of a player, distinct from power ratios), total Power per City, Land%, V/M, Tech (total techs). Added a clickable **"Legend"** text that **redirects to Sevopedia Concepts' "Score Tab Columns" page**. Note that unlike military ratios, PowT and PoT/C are shown even for the human player, since these vary every turn. Change in [CvInfoScreen.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvInfoScreen.py). See [README.md: Score Tab](/README.md#score-tab-in-the-info-screen-advisor).
 - Beautified the **Victory Screen**: **added Buttons/Icons** (Leaders, Religions, Apostolic Palace, UN, Spaceship parts, Traits as chars, etc.), **Thousands Separators**, **Victory Culture Percentages** (mirroring the changes in [CvInfoScreen.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvInfoScreen.py)). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5523+) **Always show** the **Resolutions** and **Members** tabs so now all tabs are shown **even if they are empty**, and add a **fallback table** showing **required wonders** (as of now Apostolic Palace or United Nations) to make these tabs active for exhaustiveness and clarity. Change in [CvVictoryScreen.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvVictoryScreen.py). See also [KI#115](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues_In_Base_AdvCiv_Civ4.md#115---fixed-likely-base-advciv-issue-victory-screen-vote-requirement-text-spacing-in-resolutions-tab).
 - Beautified the **Diplomacy Screen**'s **trading rows** with **icons** (e.g., Gold, Gold Per Turn, World Map, Open Borders, Vassal, Defensive Pact; and **leader icons** (make peace / declare war / embargo)). Change in `CvPlayer::getItemTradeString`. See [README.md: Diplomacy Screen](/README.md#diplomacy-screen).
-- **Main Interface (Common)**: Moved **minimap to the right-edge** for quicker read. Add **details** to most **progress bars**; e.g. in the Tech bar `Fusion: 2245 / 5774 (35)`. Show **chars in the GP bar even if 100%** (e.g. `Great Scientist: Lyons (3) - [RESEARCH_CHAR] 100%`) Change in [GPUtil.py](/Assets/Python/BUG/GPUtil.py) and [CvMainInterface.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvMainInterface.py). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5514+) **Swap top left** (e.g., Treasury) **and top right** (e.g., Turn and Year) **text position**, and optionally **move commerce sliders to the right side** (allows to freely expand advisors so they use the entire left side, and is visually closer to scoreboard and most mouse controls) **in city screen or map view**. Show **Era text default ON** (as of now on top left). See [Main interface rework](/README.md#main-interface-rework).
+- **Main Interface (Common)**: Moved **minimap to the right-edge** for quicker read. Add **details** to most **progress bars**; e.g. in the Tech bar `Fusion: 2245 / 5774 (35)`. Show **chars in the GP bar even if 100%** (e.g. `Great Scientist: Lyons (3) - [RESEARCH_CHAR] 100%`) Change in [GPUtil.py](/Assets/Python/BUG/GPUtil.py) and [CvMainInterface.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvMainInterface.py). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5514+) **Swap top left** (e.g., Treasury) **and top right** (e.g., Turn and Year) **text position**, and optionally **move commerce sliders to the right side** (allows to freely expand advisors so they use the entire left side, and is visually closer to scoreboard and most mouse controls) **in city screen or map view**. Show **Era text default ON** (as of now on top left); **strip " Era" suffix** so text is now only e.g., `Renaissance` not `Renaissance Era` (would overflow during golden age when text is upscaled, plus it is unneeded). See [Main interface rework](/README.md#main-interface-rework).
 - **Main Interface (City Screen)**: Enhanced with a new **Great Person +n ICON** information in relevant Buildings' rows; added a new **Specialists Breakdown** and **Culture Breakdown**; added **optional extra rows** in the **Production Chooser Bar** and **optionally hide the unit bar** (`"PlotListPanel"`) (note: does not affect the production chooser outside of the city screen); added **Buttons** (i.e. icons) in the **Production Queue**; fixed some hard anchored items that now **dynamically** adjust to sides' width. **Beautified** it as well: removed the 3 gray bars ("Trade Routes", "Buildings", "Specialists"), increased sides' width, made bonuses columns even in width, and other changes. These changes allow to now display more information and reduce the need for scrolling or hovering. Also **enlarged** the **Bottom-Left** and **Bottom-Right** panels so they align dynamically with the enlarged **Side Panels**. Enhanced the **city bar** and **other bars**, e.g., `Lakamha: 16 - 12372 (4500BC)` or `Growing - 30/43 (4 Turns)`. Split the **Draft group** into hurry controls on the right (and a **new draft button**) and config options on the right. Add building list filtering buttons ("Show All Buildings", "Show Regular Buildings Only", "Show National Wonders Only", "Show World Wonders Only"). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5526+) Reduce **food/production top bars' size** so text does not overflow when upscaled (also helps preserve overall distance to side panels due to increasing base font size from body to label). Change in [CvMainInterface.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvMainInterface.py). And other changes. See also [KI#101](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues_In_Base_AdvCiv_Civ4.md#101---fixed-base-advciv-bug-of-gp-bar-tooltip-in-city-screen-not-showing-gp-from-obsolete-buildings-yet-seemignly-counting-them-for-the-total-gp-calculation).
 - **Main Interface (Map View)**: **Reordered buttons** (end turn, city change arrows) and wrapped them in a **pretty panel**. Added buttons to unit stack, selected unit. (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5503+) Make **left-click on GP bar** open the **corresponding city's city screen**.
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5507+) **Main Interface (civilization flag):** **Removed the civilization flag** from the production buttons bar (next to minimap) to show more buttons instead and have a more efficient display. Instead, added **optional compact top-left civilization flag** (with same preserved BtS hover/click behavior) (if **enabled**, left **top text spacing is shifted to make room for the compact flag**). Unlike base AdvCiv, this **optional flag** is **also visible in city screen** because it does not interfere with bottom city-action buttons. This flag is useful to know player civ, hover for player traits, and click to capital's city screen. Default disabled (tunable) as it can be distracting and undesired.

